    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST OTHER GAMES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Try out the free prologue to get a taste of the exciting gameplay and easily transfer your progress to the full game.<br><br><strong>Transfer your progress to the main game</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/13953fe722154b8399ebabe8b55931b9.poster.avif?t=1743024284\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/13953fe722154b8399ebabe8b55931b9.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The main game offers three acts, 38 areas, mini-games, and a lot of gear options for your hero. Progress seamlessly transfers from the prologue to the main game.<br><br><strong>Face 10 Levels and 2 Boss Battles</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/df823fffcbdb3a9804eacef736251e50.poster.avif?t=1743024284\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/df823fffcbdb3a9804eacef736251e50.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Face the challenge of 10 distinct levels, each filled with hordes of mythic monsters. Try 6 different armies and test your skills against Arachne at the end of the prologue.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Build and Power Up Your Army</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/b4f2f6e336fd4694330548f7ffaae818.poster.avif?t=1743024284\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/b4f2f6e336fd4694330548f7ffaae818.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Customize your build by trying out various gear combinations you come across. Find the perfect match for your playstyle as you explore. Strengthen your army by upgrading them and merging with the Hero to amplify your power, ready to face and conquer the enemy.<br><br><strong>War technique</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/5772809481d323c6da3e9e6ba451fc8a.poster.avif?t=1743024284\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/5772809481d323c6da3e9e6ba451fc8a.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Elevate your armies with War Technique\u2014a fresh way to upgrade. Experiment with various combos and effortlessly switch up your enhancements for effective improvements.",
