ps/2738430/extras/b4f2f6e336fd4694330548f7ffaae818.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Customize your build by trying out various gear combinations you come across. Find the perfect match for your playstyle as you explore. Strengthen your army by upgrading them and merging with the Hero to amplify your power, ready to face and conquer the enemy.<br><br><strong>War technique</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/5772809481d323c6da3e9e6ba451fc8a.poster.avif?t=1743024284\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738430/extras/5772809481d323c6da3e9e6ba451fc8a.webm?t=1743024284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Elevate your armies with War Technique\u2014a fresh way to upgrade. Experiment with various combos and effortlessly switch up your enhancements for effective improvements.",
